OL,3,GNEWSABurnham announces plans to clean
OL,4,Aup worst three illegal waste dumps
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree of the country's worst illegal
OL,7,Fdumps are due to be cleaned up using
OL,8,Ftaxpayers' money, the government has
OL,9,Fannounced.
OL,11,FSites in Kent, Surrey and West
OL,12,FYorkshire will be assessed for
OL,13,Fclearance, with Prime Minister Andy
OL,14,FBurnham saying the "toxic dumps have
OL,15,Fblighted communities for too long".
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
